    "title": "Security remediation awkit-3gtj: B2, screenshot and trace capture residuals near protected-login surfaces",
    "objective": "Reproduce each awkit-3gtj finding in real Chromium before fixing it. B2 failure capture, the user screenshot step and ScreenshotService capture into memory inside a watched window (frame navigations, frame attachments and a mutation sentinel) and write only after a clean re-check, so a late or contradicted capture never leaves a file. The shared guard also scans closed shadow roots through a CDP pierce pass. TraceService records network only inside a watched step, watches each page with the sentinel, and purges a tainted session's raw files from Playwright's temporary artifacts directory. Findings that cannot be reproduced are recorded with exact negative evidence in KNOWN_ISSUES.",
